  "prompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Asset type: Japanese elementary vocabulary illustrations, sheet 62. Edit the provided 2048x2048 template, painting ONLY inside its sixteen white panels. Every single panel MUST have identical width and height. All horizontal lines must be EXACTLY at 0%,25%,50%,75%,100%, not based on artwork. Keep precisely the 4x4 equal grid and 5 continuous pure magenta #ff00ff lines in each direction, including outer frame. Preserve line position, width and full canvas. Each panel is an independent clear gentle picture-book illustration as isolated vignettes on a pure white background, large and easily understood. Never use magenta for illustration. Avoid all pink, purple and neon colors in artwork, objects, decorations, lighting and shadows. Use warm orange, red, yellow, green, blue and neutral colors. No pink/purple concert lights. Nothing crosses the grid. No text, letters, numbers, labels, symbols resembling writing or watermarks. For abstract words show a concrete situation illustrating the meaning. Diverse natural children and adults, no stereotypes. Correct anatomy and objects. Panels in strict row-major order (left to right, top to bottom):\n1. 樹齢 — 木が生えてからの年数。\n2. 受話器 — 電話で相手の声を聞き自分の声を伝える部分。\n3. 純度 — ほかの成分が混ざっていない度合い。\n4. 順路 — 決められた順に進む道筋。\n5. 浄化 — 汚れたものをきれいにすること。\n6. 上下 — 上と下。\n7. 乗馬 — 馬に乗ること。\n8. 女王 — 女性の王。\n9. 除外 — 対象から取り除くこと。\n10. 除去 — 必要のないものを取り除くこと。\n11. 徐行 — すぐ止まれるくらいゆっくり進むこと。\n12. 助手 — 主に仕事をする人を手伝う人。\n13. 除草 — 不要な草を取り除くこと。\n14. 女優 — 女性の俳優。\n15. ジョーク — 人を笑わせるための冗談。\n16. 自力 — ほかの人の助けだけに頼らない自分の力。\nSafety and clarity: Vehicles must be driven only by unmistakable adults, never children. Industrial machinery and knives are used by adults. Do not put a child in a car driver's seat. Keep artwork separated by the measured template grid.\nDo not add numerical claims, prices, quantities, currency denominations, calorie values or stroke-order numbers unless explicitly required by the target word. Mathematical concepts should have neutral concrete examples without unverified numeric diagrams.\n",
